bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
control ChapterService
control MangaService
control UserService
control NotificationService
entity ":ReplyModel" as ReplyModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Reply to a comment
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /create-reply-chapter
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. createCommentChapter(dto, req)
activate ReplyController

ReplyController -> ReplyController: 3. Check token / role
activate ReplyController
space
deactivate ReplyController

opt Token / Role Invalid
    ReplyController --> Router: 3.1 401 / 403 Error
    Router --> UI: 3.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 3.3 Error message
end

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 4. createReplyChapter(dto, payload)
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 5. checkLegitUser(payload)
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

loop User not exist / User is banned
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.1 Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.2 400 Error
    Router --> UI: 5.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 5.4 Error message
end

ref over ReplyService, MongoDB: 3.44.b.i. Subsequence - Reply comment 1

ReplyService -> UserService: 6. getUserById(receiver_id)
activate UserService
UserService --> ReplyService: 7. receiver
deactivate UserService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 8. Check receiver
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

ReplyService -> NotificationService: 9. createNotification(dto)
activate NotificationService
NotificationService --> ReplyService: 10. send_noti_result
deactivate NotificationService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 11. Check author exists
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

opt Manga has author
    ReplyService -> UserService: 11.1. removeDeviceId(authorId, send_noti_result)
    activate UserService
    UserService --> ReplyService: 11.2. done
    deactivate UserService
end

ReplyService --> ReplyController: 12. savedReply
deactivate ReplyService

ReplyController --> Router: 13. HTTP response (success)
deactivate ReplyController
Router --> UI: 14. Update UI
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 15. View new reply
deactivate UI
deactivate User